{"v":1,"id":["01KZPV9Y01T735VX6PHGDRJE0Z","01KZPV9WSPBTRHZ0EBYVS5RJGM"],"edit.description":{"id":"01KZPV9P2VX3KT1CBQHN1WN2T4","md":"Requirement (user, verbatim intent):\n1. Remove the \"History\" label to the left of the timeline — user wants a rich, uncluttered history to demo.\n2. Move all other elements (read-only banner, mode toggle buttons, hover/\"Now\" label) so they sit above the timeline track, rather than inline beside it — so they never push/resize the scrubber track when they appear or disappear (e.g. the read-only banner showing up while scrubbing).\n3. Rename the \"Real time\" toggle option to something better than \"Real time\" — user suggested \"Timeline\" as a candidate. Landed on \"Frames\" (even, gapless filmstrip) vs \"Timeline\" (true chronological/proportional spacing) as the pair.\n\nStanding instruction reaffirmed: every new user request gets documented here as a ticket (or via comments/description), not just tracked internally."}}
